{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02562","headline":"安德山池宴集 · 许敬宗","name":"安德山池宴集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戚里欢娱地，园林瞩望新。\n山庭带芳杜，歌吹叶阳春。\n台榭疑巫峡，荷蕖似洛滨。\n风花萦少女，虹梁聚美人。\n宴游穷至乐，谈笑毕良辰。\n独叹高阳晚，归路不知津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02562.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02562","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}